tributed code, or help"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"ed test it. Its value was not only in the features we built, but in exploring together how Agents co"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"uld take part in everyday work."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"**For existing users:**"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"- Ending maintenance does not immediately disable existing installations, but future DSH upgrades ma"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"y break compatibility. Validate your setup before relying on it for critical unattended work.\n- Task"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"s, permissions, model and skill settings, execution history, and dsh-im delivery settings **do not a"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"utomatically migrate to the official features**. Those features are not guaranteed to cover these ca"},{"id":"p8s5","text":"pabilities.\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Get started"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Targets DSH **0.1.7-rc.2** and its current APIs. Older Host versions are not supported."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Restart `dsh web`, open a workspace, and make your first request:"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"> Every weekday at 6 PM in Asia/Shanghai, summarize today's changes, next actions, and blockers. Rea"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"d only; don't change files. Show me the configuration before creating it."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"The Agent previews the schedule, permissions, and other settings. **It creates the task only after y"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"ou confirm.** Or choose New automation in the sidebar and start from a built-in template."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Plans change: just say “Move the daily handoff to 7 PM.” To receive results in chat, select a bot an"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"d saved target under Edit → Message delivery. Set up message delivery ↗"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"> **Keep DSH running** for scheduled tasks. Runs have a 1-hour limit by default, and interactive app"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"rovals are never granted automatically. How execution works →"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Demo"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Copy an example to your Agent and adjust the time or scope. **Every task requires a configuration pr"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"eview and your confirmation before creation.** Fill in missing essentials, such as log paths, before"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"nfirmation before creation.** Fill in missing essentials, such as log paths, before saving the task."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"🌙 A handoff before you log off\nRecurring · Read only · Notify after each run\nCreate a daily handoff "},{"id":"p19s2","text":"for weekdays at 18:00 in Asia/Shanghai. Read today's commits and uncommitted workspace changes. Repo"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"rt completed work, next actions, and blockers with evidence; say so if nothing changed. Do not modif"},{"id":"p19s4","text":"y files. Notify me after each run."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"🚀 A check before the release\nOne-time · A verdict with evidence\nCreate a one-time release check for "},{"id":"p20s2","text":"tomorrow at 09:00 in Asia/Shanghai. Read the workspace's version configuration, release docs, and un"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"committed changes. Report Ready or Blocked with evidence, and list anything not verified. Do not mod"},{"id":"p20s4","text":"ify files or publish anything."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"📦 A Monday dependency review\nRecurring · Choose models and skills\nCreate a dependency review for Mon"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"days at 09:30 in Asia/Shanghai. First list the available models and skills for me to choose. Inspect"},{"id":"p21s3","text":" manifests and lockfiles, consult accessible official release notes, and report upgrade priorities, "},{"id":"p21s4","text":"compatibility risks, and sources. Do not install or upgrade anything."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"💬 Keep an investigation moving\nPinned session · Retain context\nCreate an investigation follow-up for"},{"id":"p22s2","text":" weekdays at 10:00 in Asia/Shanghai, pinned to our investigation session in this workspace. Show me "},{"id":"p22s3","text":"the target session for confirmation first. Read the logs I specify, build on our existing conclusion"},{"id":"p22s4","text":"s, and report new evidence and next steps. Do not repeat the entire history or modify files."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"📨 A weekly report delivered to chat\nRecurring · Optional dsh-im delivery\nCreate a weekly report for "},{"id":"p23s2","text":"Fridays at 17:00 in Asia/Shanghai. Read this week's workspace commits and project docs. Produce a sh"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"ort chat-ready briefing: completed work, unresolved issues, and suggested next steps. Do not modify "},{"id":"p23s4","text":"files or invent progress; flag missing evidence."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"📝 Keep project docs up to date\nRecurring · Controlled file changes\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}

